PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow::
    .string "POKéMON learn new techniques as\n"
    .string "they grow.\p"
    .string "But some moves must be taught to\n"
    .string "them by people.$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused::
    .string "A POKéMON becomes easier to \n"
    .string "catch if it has a status problem.\p"
    .string "Sleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\n"
    .string "Those are all effective.\p"
    .string "But catching POKéMON is never\n"
    .string "a sure thing!$"


PewterCity_House2_Text_OldManAsk::
    .string "My old POKéMON got burned on the\n"
    .string "Pyropia volcano road. The\lheat never forgets.\pTwo BURN HEALS would ease it.$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_OldManOffer::
    .string "BURN HEALS! May I have two for my\n"
    .string "old friend?$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_OldManGives::
    .string "Ah, the pain is gone. Thank you!\pTake this IRON. It makes a\n"
    .string "POKéMON sturdier, I'm told.$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_OldManNo::
    .string "No hurry. Old burns heal slowly.$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_LittleBoyAsk::
    .string "My POKéMON fell asleep in battle\n"
    .string "and never woke up!\pIf you have an AWAKENING, can\n"
    .string "you help us?$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_LittleBoyOffer::
    .string "An AWAKENING! Can you give me\n"
    .string "one?$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_LittleBoyGives::
    .string "It's awake! It's awake!\pHere, my dad gave me these for\n"
    .string "training. You can have them!$"

PewterCity_House2_Text_LittleBoyNo::
    .string "Oh... I'll let it nap, then.$"
